Before substantive repository work, read and follow
`<WORKFLOW_ROOT>/references/KERNEL.md`. Treat the repository's native
instructions as its project adapter. If the kernel cannot be opened, stop and
report the incomplete V2 installation. Load detailed V2 phase procedures only
when that phase is selected by a clear request or valid workflow handoff;
ordinary questions and status requests do not start a formal phase.
